  triage:resolutionNote "PR #1295 head advanced to d06d82b69 via a single TOML-only commit (fix(boundary): align Herdr doctor sanitizer root, authored by Rand). Diff confirmed to touch exactly boundaries/atm-core/herdr-endpoint-doctor.toml, 2 insertions/2 deletions: [composition].roots flipped from atm_herdr::doctor_probe to atm_herdr::transport, and the [status].notes prose updated to state that transport.rs's private endpoint-display helper is the sole permitted from_relative call site, with HerdrDoctorProbe consuming the already-sanitized display -- matching the AY.9 C1a intent exactly, no other policy field (forbidden references, ownership, visibility) touched. git merge-base --is-ancestor d06d82b69 d06d82b69 confirms the fix commit is the pinned re-verify head itself. Live CI at d06d82b69 (gh pr checks 1295 --json) shows Just lint (ubuntu-latest) SUCCESS -- boundaries check now passes -- plus Clippy, Format check, Classify CI scope, all five Hermes ATM jobs, and all three Test-matrix legs (Test ubuntu-latest, Test macos-latest, Test windows-latest) all SUCCESS: 17/17 checks green. qa-pr1295-r2 additionally re-verified locally: diff scope limited to the TOML, from_relative call sites confirmed still only in transport.rs (4 sites, lines 189/200/231/247), doctor_probe.rs confirmed to have zero direct HerdrEndpointDisplay references (consumes the sanitized display only), and local lint/build/test all green. Closing on this evidence." .
